gent基于 asyncio 实现客观题规则引擎、简答题/编程题 LLM 评分三轨并行，并通过"}, {"type": "text", "content": "interrupt()", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 机制嵌入教师人工审核断点（Human-in-the-Loop）。"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.044, 0.889, 0.95, 0.929], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "参与封装 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "LLM Factory", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 统一模型路由与实例缓存，设计\"自动重试→Agent 降级→系统兜底\"三层容错机制，知识库检索与联网搜索封装为 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "MCP Tool", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 供各 Agent 统一调用。"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.036, 0.939, 0.129, 0.958], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "项目优化:"}], "level": 2}]}], "is_full_document": false, "schema": "docvortex.middle", "schema_version": "2.0"}